message: >-
  Cite Biology and Life Sciences Foundational Branch Paper 001 version 1.0 for
  the Biology results used, and cite each other branch through its own
  immutable DOI.
title: "Ernos Labs Smithian Fold Theory Open Science Platform and Knowledge Tree"
type: software
