repository-code: "https://github.com/MettaMazza/ernos-labs-sft-platform"
url: "https://github.com/MettaMazza/ernos-labs-sft-platform"
abstract: >-
  Accessible Python clean-room reconstruction of Smithian Fold Theory with one
  fail-closed admission engine, exact candidate enumeration, unique-survivor
  forcing, adverse controls, independent reconstruction, sealed empirical
  comparison and immutable receipts. The Biology and Life Sciences foundation
  contains 75 engine-admitted laws from 19,200 enumerated candidates, 300
  passing adverse controls, 75 independent reconstructions and 75 post-seal
  comparisons. Its V1/V2 audit reviews all 763 prior entries and closes all 30
  Biology-owned atoms while preserving 21 corrected evidence boundaries.
keywords:
  - Smithian Fold Theory
  - exact arithmetic
  - computational proof
  - empirical validation
  - clean-room reconstruction
  - open science
  - reproducibility
